# Root-level ignore rules for this repo.
#
# frontend/ and worker/ each have their own .gitignore for project-specific
# build artifacts (node_modules, .next, .wrangler, etc.) — this file covers
# secrets/key material that could land anywhere in the repo (see
# docs/ARCHITECTURE_DECISION_RECORDS.md §16), plus dependency directories that
# now exist at additional levels since the pnpm workspace (M1) was introduced
# (root node_modules/, packages/*/node_modules/).
#
# Deliberately narrow otherwise: no broad extension bans that could catch
# legitimate application assets (e.g. this does NOT ignore *.pdf, *.json, or
# any extensionless file in general — only well-known credential/key patterns
# and the standard node_modules/ convention).

# ── Dependencies (pnpm workspace) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unanchored, so it matches at every level: root, packages/*, frontend, worker.
node_modules/

# ── SSH keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Explicitly named: the keypair found sitting in the repo root during the
# platform audit (never committed — see the ADR doc's security assessment).
gitkey
gitkey.pub

# Default SSH key basenames, in case a future `ssh-keygen` run targets the
# repo directory by accident instead of ~/.ssh/.
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub
id_dsa
id_dsa.pub
id_ecdsa
id_ecdsa.pub
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub

# ── Certificates / signing keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Covers TLS/SSH private keys, PKCS#12/PFX bundles, X.509 certs, Java/Android
# keystores, and iOS provisioning profiles (relevant once mobile signing
# material exists).
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
*.jks
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision

# ── Local secrets / environment files ─────────────────────────────────────────
# frontend/.gitignore and worker/.gitignore already cover their own .env* /
# .dev.vars* files; these root-level patterns catch the same kind of file if
# one is ever added directly at the repo root.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example

# ── Machine-local / editor-tool files ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Named specifically, not a blanket ".claude/" ignore, in case shared
# (non-local) config is ever added under .claude/ later.
.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
